  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 456 × 4 − 3 ÷ 11 + 70 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '−' are interchanged and '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n456 × 4 − 3 ÷ 11 + 70 = ? ⇒ 456 ÷ 4 + 3 × 11 − 70 = ?\n\n⇒ __**456 ÷**____** 4**__ + 3 × 11 − 70 = ?\n\n⇒ 114 + __**3 **____**×**____** 11**__ − 70 = ?\n\n⇒ __**11**____**4 + 33**__ − 70 = ?\n\n⇒ __147____** −**____** 70**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 77 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
